t":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125673962638094452","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@marckohlbrugge Very far from the ideal form, but this is where openai dots are going\n\nI mean you can already use it like this except for the generative UI compoenents, but they already have intelligetn UI everywhere else so i guess soon it will arrive to dot chat as well","url":"https://x.com/RodrigoSanudo/status/2125721186487455885"},{"author_id":"15482172","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:35:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125720015274123290"],"id":"2125720015274123290","in_reply_to_user_id":"70315924","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125486980956106950","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@n8peace @ChrisLaBossiere But where is this coffee?\n\nIf you pop up in vancouver I can make you a pretty Decent Espresso. \n\nEx. Software engineer, ex digital marketer, trying to work out how many mcps my Dot needs","url":"https://x.com/philberryman/status/2125720015274123290"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2125716827678347264"]},"author_id":"2118524369831931904","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:24:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125717205346328789"],"id":"2125717205346328789","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"being a teacher in 2026...\n\nSpending time with my family, preparing for thanksgiving while codex and my dot edit 3 full length ed puzzle videos and create aligned assessments in google forms for me. thanks @OpenAI @gdb @sama https://t.co/W45iXejG7I","url":"https://x.com/mrdoudini/status/2125717205346328789"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125715237051543553"]},"author_id":"2061190190752747521","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:16:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125715248741302724"],"id":"2125715248741302724","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":63,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Next time I'm going to grab larger targets and push it out to 15 yards instead of 7 yards.\n\nI'm pretty much done with the P229 now though, so I'll be putting a lot more rounds through the TX22 and 1911 until I get the P226. I might also start shooting the Dagger a bit.\n\nTargets https://t.co/juXbVP5AcX","url":"https://x.com/Noioso2A/status/2125715248741302724"},{"author_id":"1261533411115556867","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:16:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125715149852234166"],"id":"2125715149852234166","in_reply_to_user_id":"58865213","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125681797682069566","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@ajambrosino A lot of Australian sites don’t work when my dot or even computer use is trying to access them. Vision Pro app is poorly optimised.","url":"https://x.com/MCLang88/status/2125715149852234166"},{"author_id":"261353394","created_at":"2026-11-25T21:56:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125710204486488363"],"id":"2125710204486488363","in_reply_to_user_id":"162124540","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":19,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125377328629031248","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@gdb I tried giving my dot multiple pathways and 3 days to make me one video.  I never got that video.  Gemini in antigravity had it for me in 10 minutes and exceeded my expectations.  Dots are shit.  I feel really sorry for Peter because he has to be regretting not choosing meta over","url":"https://x.com/JoeMcCarley/status/2125710204486488363"},{"author_id":"1083719964991852544","created_at":"2026-11-25T21:44:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125707163868049721"],"id":"2125707163868049721","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":69,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Gonna be honest, ChatGPT Work and ChatGPT Dots loses a lot of the benefits of AI because of all the websites blocking AI functionality. \n\nKinda sucks, I know it’s not OpenAI’s fault or any other AI provider, but if I tell my dot “hey report xxx issue to this company” and then it","url":"https://x.com/MichaelM_117/status/2125707163868049721"},{"author_id":"1634939949869875200","created_at":"2026-11-25T21:44:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125707144527811071"],"id":"2125707144527811071","in_reply_to_user_id":"58865213","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":14,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125681797682069566","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@ajambrosino 1. I can manage my Mac’s Codex threads and projects remotely from my iPhone, but not from ChatGPT in a browser.\n2. Switching to the Codex tab on iOS interrupts an active Dot call.\n3. Dot voice reads old messages aloud before I can speak and sometimes keeps talking after I ask it","url":"https://x.com/EliotGevers/status/2125707144527811071"},{"author_id":"1262219683","created_at":"2026-11-25T21:41:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125706503999091162"],"id":"2125706503999091162","in_reply_to_user_id":"58865213","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125681797682069566","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@ajambrosino bug: USPS (the postal carrier) blocks my dot for reading the site. make the dot work around these blocks, like by using other devices on my network.","url":"https://x.com/KastanDay/status/2125706503999091162"},{"author_id":"2115551276591153152","created_at":"2026-11-25T21:40:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125706296565629266"],"id":"2125706296565629266","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"repl